 owner of the plane that crashed off the coast of Nova Scotia in 1998?","correct":"Swiss Air","wrong":["Air France","British Airways","TWA"]},{"id":"5c974e03bd32","q":"In the Morse code, which letter is indicated by 3 dots?","correct":"S","wrong":["O","A","C"]},{"id":"498769c020ad","q":"The Swedish word \"Grunka\" means what in English?","correct":"Thing","wrong":["People","Place","Pineapple"]},{"id":"61980b5d7a0f","q":"According to Fair Works Australia, how long do you have to work to get Long Service Leave?","correct":"7 years","wrong":["2 years","8 years","6 months"]},{"id":"7a6c7750ac0d","q":"In what year did Canada stop producing the penny?","correct":"2012","wrong":["2013","2011","2010"]},{"id":"106d4f7dd86c","q":"Which candy is NOT made by Mars?","correct":"Almond Joy","wrong":["M&M's","Twix","Snickers"]},{"id":"6bdadd0d25d5","q":"How many furlongs are there in a mile?","correct":"Eight","wrong":["Two","Four","Six"]},{"id":"3d5b199e06b0","q":"What is the star sign of someone born on Valentines day?","correct":"Aquarius","wrong":["Pisces","Capricorn","Scorpio"]},{"id":"c0957adef8cb","q":"In the fictional SCP universe what “Object Class” is given to SCP’s that cannot be contained.","correct":"Apollyon","wrong":["Thaumiel","Keter-Thaumiel","Esoteric/Narrative Classes"]},{"id":"a164e38701c3","q":"Which of these Marvel games was released on the Playstation 2?","correct":"Spider-Man 2","wrong":["Silver Surfer","Howard the Duck","Wolverine: Adamantium Rage"]},{"id":"e3f974ae9a89","q":"The phrase \"accident waiting to happen\" is an example of what type of figure of speech?","correct":"Idiom","wrong":["Simile","Metaphor","Analogy"]},{"id":"5023fd9771e6","q":"What geometric shape is generally used for stop signs?","correct":"Octagon","wrong":["Hexagon","Circle","Triangle"]},{"id":"a3bbb6e60b55","q":"The new One World Trade Center in Manhattan, New York City was designed by which architect?","correct":"David Childs","wrong":["Bjarke Ingels","Michael Arad","Fumihiko Mak