ng":["Dust clouds absorb light","Redshift doesn't let us see distant stars","Quantum mechanics"]},{"id":"5662b25c3422","q":"When was Nintendo founded?","correct":"September 23rd, 1889","wrong":["October 19th, 1891","March 4th, 1887","December 27th, 1894"]},{"id":"571c94ff3ea9","q":"Which of the General Mills Corporation's monster cereals was the last to be released in the 1970's?","correct":"Fruit Brute","wrong":["Count Chocula","Franken Berry","Boo-Berry"]},{"id":"247a2dea19bd","q":"What step in cellular respiration forms ATP?","correct":"Oxidative Phosphorylation","wrong":["Glycolysis","Pyruvate Oxidation","Calvin Cycle"]},{"id":"26f3eed17475","q":"Who is depicted on the US hundred dollar bill?","correct":"Benjamin Franklin","wrong":["George Washington","Abraham Lincoln","Thomas Jefferson"]},{"id":"a8bd3c3809aa","q":"Whose greyscale face is on the kappa emoticon on Twitch?","correct":"Josh DeSeno","wrong":["Justin DeSeno","John DeSeno","Jimmy DeSeno"]},{"id":"2c14bdc6911a","q":"Which of these fast-food chains is NOT mainly known to sell pizza?","correct":"Wendy's","wrong":["Domino's","Little Caesars","Papa John's"]},{"id":"01d54c5b9ec8","q":"Which of the following chemicals are found in eggplant seeds?","correct":"Nicotine","wrong":["Mescaline","Cyanide","Psilocybin"]},{"id":"5b7d9ec2fe9c","q":"What direction does the Statue of Liberty face?","correct":"Southeast","wrong":["Southwest","Northwest","Northeast"]},{"id":"4bf69c3558ad","q":"Which mountain has the highest peak in Europe?","correct":"Mount Elbrus, Russia","wrong":["Shkhara, Georgia","Mount Ararat, Turkey","Mont Blanc, France"]},{"id":"c9fc5177c4c0","q":"What company owns Outlook?","correct":"Microsoft","wrong":["Google","Apple","Yahoo"]},{"id":"97e10db8f774","q":"Electronic music producer Kygo's popularity skyrocketed after a certain remix. Which song did he remix?","correct":"Ed Sheeran - I See Fire","wrong":["Marvin Gaye - Sexual Healing","Coldplay - Midnight","a-ha - Take On Me"]},{"id":"358cd17e268a"