ect, but not write?","correct":"The Straight Story","wrong":["Inland Empire","Lost Highway","Twin Peaks Fire Walk With Me"]},{"id":"aa14f0de8156","q":"Who voiced Metalbeard in \"The Lego Movie\"?","correct":"Nick Offerman","wrong":["Liam Neeson","Morgan Freeman","Will Arnet"]},{"id":"714bb5d21caf","q":"What was the first James Bond film?","correct":"Dr. No","wrong":["Goldfinger","From Russia With Love","Thunderball"]},{"id":"8af29d0d7a25","q":"Which singer is portrayed by Bruce Campbell in the 2002 film 'Bubba Ho-Tep'?","correct":"Elvis Presley","wrong":["Johnny Cash","Hank Williams, Sr.","Buddy Holly"]},{"id":"4ddd3ff3bb3c","q":"Which year was the first official Youtube Rewind released?","correct":"2010","wrong":["2012","2011","2013"]},{"id":"fc4692f4a195","q":"Which actor auditioned for the role of Luke Skywalker?","correct":"Kurt Russell","wrong":["Christopher Lambert","Laurence Fishburne","James Remar"]},{"id":"a7796c5ee781","q":"Which of these movies is NOT considered to be part of the Marvel Cinematic Universe?","correct":"Fantastic Four (2015)","wrong":["Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017)","The Incredible Hulk (2008)","Captain Marvel (2019)"]},{"id":"e4b7780331c9","q":"In the Mad Max franchise, what type of car is the Pursuit Special driven by Max?","correct":"Ford Falcon","wrong":["Holden Monaro","Chrysler Valiant Charger","Pontiac Firebird"]},{"id":"64482d8ec4d7","q":"In \"ALF\", what was ALF's real name?","correct":"Gordon Shumway","wrong":["Gordon Milipp","Gordon Foster","Gordon von Gam"]},{"id":"2175ad1a0ffb","q":"What is the birth name of Michael Caine?","correct":"Maurice Micklewhite","wrong":["Morris Coleman","Carl Myers","Martin Michaels"]},{"id":"4ac3a00ab3a0","q":"Which of the following was not one of \"The Magnificent Seven\"?","correct":"Clint Eastwood","wrong":["Steve McQueen","Charles Bronson","Robert Vaughn"]},{"id":"a1d488f27696","q":"Which one of these action movies are shot entirely in one take?","correct":"Victoria","wrong":["Ip Man 2","The Bou