 Pool\"?","correct":"Dirty Harry","wrong":["Indiana Jones","James Bond","Harry Potter"]},{"id":"badcca4b8e9c","q":"What is the name of the foley artist who designed the famous sounds of Star Wars, including Chewbacca's roar and R2-D2's beeps and whistles?","correct":"Ben Burtt","wrong":["Ken Burns","Ralph McQuarrie","Miranda Keyes"]},{"id":"6f4b559d8719","q":"Who voiced the character Draco in the 1996 movie 'DragonHeart'?","correct":"Sean Connery","wrong":["Dennis Quaid","Pete Postlethwaite","Brian Thompson"]},{"id":"4a79c49407b3","q":"What Queen song plays during the final fight scene of the film \"Hardcore Henry\"?","correct":"Don't Stop Me Now","wrong":["Brighton Rock","Another Bites the Dust","We Will Rock You"]},{"id":"e91f8c2077e9","q":"Who plays \"Bruce Wayne\" in the 2008 movie \"The Dark Knight\"?","correct":"Christian Bale","wrong":["Michael Caine","Ron Dean","Heath Ledger"]},{"id":"d3dfba1abf9b","q":"In Tron: Legacy, Kevin Flynn wrote a program to create the perfect system. What was the program's name?","correct":"Clu","wrong":["Tron","MCP","Quorra"]},{"id":"6b48b7cd39dc","q":"In 2012, which movie won every category in the 32nd \"Golden Raspberry Awards\"?","correct":"Jack and Jill","wrong":["The Girl with the Dragon Tattoo","Thor","The King's Speech"]},{"id":"2f346272fc99","q":"Which of these films is NOT set in Los Angeles?","correct":"RoboCop","wrong":["Blade Runner","The Terminator","Predator 2"]},{"id":"bd496353279e","q":"The 1939 movie \"The Wizard of Oz\" contained a horse that changed color, what material did they use to achieve this effect?","correct":"Gelatin","wrong":["Dye","Paint","CGI Effect"]},{"id":"1ea9cb836f4a","q":"In the 2002 film \"Kung Pow! Enter the Fist\", why was Wimp Lo purposely trained wrong?","correct":"As a joke","wrong":["For cheating","Revenge","To test him"]},{"id":"deb0b248b5ae","q":"In the 1984 movie \"The Terminator\", what model number is the Terminator portrayed by Arnold Schwarzenegger?","correct":"T-800","wrong":["I-