","Full Metal Jacket"]},{"id":"1d1c74270eee","q":"What breed of dog was Marley in the film \"Marley & Me\" (2008)?","correct":"Labrador Retriever","wrong":["Golden Retriever","Dalmatian","Shiba Inu"]},{"id":"c7d42bba7d05","q":"Daniel Radcliffe became a global star in the film industry due to his performance in which film franchise?","correct":"Harry Potter","wrong":["Ted","Spy Kids","Pirates of the Caribbean"]},{"id":"b1ba677fb8ca","q":"Who played the female lead in the 1933 film \"King Kong\"?","correct":"Fay Wray","wrong":["Jean Harlow","Vivien Leigh","Mae West"]},{"id":"c50db171326b","q":"Which of these actors/actresses is NOT a part of the cast for the 2016 movie \"Suicide Squad\"?","correct":"Scarlett Johansson","wrong":["Jared Leto","Will Smith","Margot Robbie"]},{"id":"43c13b918a10","q":"Which movie of film director Stanley Kubrick is known to be an adaptation of a Stephen King novel?","correct":"The Shining","wrong":["2001: A Space Odyssey","Dr. Strangelove","Eyes Wide Shut"]},{"id":"4a974b971dac","q":"In Avengers: Infinity War, the Reality Stone (aka the Aether) was kept under safe possession by who?","correct":"The Collector","wrong":["Doctor Strange","The Grandmaster","Scarlet Witch"]},{"id":"462181a2f726","q":"Which of these actors have NOT played Spiderman in the movies?","correct":"Michael Cera","wrong":["Tobey Maguire","Andrew Garfield","Tom Holland"]},{"id":"9200b30aeb80","q":"Before \"Jurassic Park III\" was finalized and the Spinosaurus was chosen, which dinosaur was going to be the star?","correct":"Baryonyx","wrong":["Tyrannosaurus Rex","Velociraptor","Suchomimus"]},{"id":"4e8874fe75b3","q":"Who played Sgt. Gordon Elias in 'Platoon' (1986)?","correct":"Willem Dafoe","wrong":["Charlie Sheen","Matt Damon","Johnny Depp"]},{"id":"ea4999a87882","q":"Which James Bond film had the theme song written and performed by English singer-songwriter Adele?","correct":"Skyfall","wrong":["Casino Royale","Quantum Solace","Spectre"]},{"id":"2d0e7d0982c9","q":"Actress Susan Sarandon caught pneumonia during filming of which movie?","correct":"The Rocky Horror Picture Show","wrong":["Thelma and Louise","Dead Man Walking","Enchanted"]},{"id":"73ac432ab994","q":"In the 1999 movie Fight Club, which of these is not a rule of the \"fight club\"?","correct":"Always wear a shirt","wrong":["You do not talk about FIGHT CLUB","Only two guys to a fight","Fights will go on as long as they have to"]},{"id":"47f95c2ae204","q":"Who plays the character of Po in the Kung Fu Panda movies?","correct":"Jack Black","wrong":["Mirana Jonnes","McConahey Ramses","Jim Petersson"]},{"id":"1ba20b2276cd","q":"Who directed \"E.T. the Extra-Terrestrial\" (1982)?","correct":"Steven Spielberg","wrong":["Stanley Kubrick","James Cameron","Tim Burton"]},{"id":"14a3b3958dc3","q":"In the 1971 film \"Willy Wonka & the Chocolate Factory\", who played Willy Wonka?","correct":"Gene Wilder","wrong":["Shia LeBouf","Peter Ostrum","Johnny Depp"]},{"id":"7eaf9dabd88e","q":"Which actors made up the trio in \"The Good, the Bad, and the Ugly\"?","correct":"Clint Eastwood, Eli Wallach, and Lee Van Cleef","wrong":["Sergio Leone, Ennio Morricone, and Tonino Delli Colli","Yul Brynner, Steve McQueen, and Charles Bronson","Aldo Giuffrè, Mario Brega, and Luigi Pistilli"]},{"id":"b664f7a259a0","q":"Which musical artist had a prominent role in the 2017 film \"Kingsman: The Golden Circle\"?","correct":"Elton John","wrong":["Lady Gaga","Rihanna","Justin Bieber"]},{"id":"e91085922e71","q":"Which one of these films are shot entirely in one-take?","correct":"Russian Ark","wrong":["Good Will Hunting","Birdman","Schindler's List"]},{"id":"7bac045377b4","q":"What is the name of the fictional retro-mod band starring Austin Powers as the lead vocalist?","correct":"Ming Tea","wrong":["Cough Fi","Spear Mint","Mister E"]},{"id":"57faac89235d","q":"In the Super Mario Bros. Movie (2023), who plays Toad?","correct":"Keegan-Michael Key","wrong":["Seth Rogan","Charlie Day","Jack Black"]},{"id":"b2d31e7f9