tice?","correct":"Woman","wrong":["Randy","Safe and Sound","Pleasure"]},{"id":"2c9c5aa06c78","q":"Who wrote the song \"You Know You Like It\"?","correct":"AlunaGeorge","wrong":["DJ Snake","Steve Aoki","Major Lazer"]},{"id":"34e3ac73be76","q":"\"The Day the Music Died\" was a tragic plane crash that killed three musicians in which decade?","correct":"50's","wrong":["60's","70's","40's"]},{"id":"8afb31128225","q":"Which brass instrument has the lowest pitch in an orchestra?","correct":"Tuba","wrong":["Trumpet","Saxophone","Trombone"]},{"id":"00410ca09073","q":"What was the title of ABBA`s first UK hit single?","correct":"Waterloo","wrong":["Mamma Mia","Fernando","Dancing Queen"]},{"id":"aa8e1bd88818","q":"EDM producer Marshmello performs live wearing clothes and a marshmallow mask of what colour?","correct":"White","wrong":["Black","Blue","Yellow"]},{"id":"896af1ab61ed","q":"What country did Shirley Bassey originate from?","correct":"Wales","wrong":["America","England","Canada"]},{"id":"05774a8f91a1","q":"Who released the song \"Photograph\" in 2005?","correct":"Nickelback","wrong":["Fall Out Boy","Coldplay","Green Day"]},{"id":"427d554c7326","q":"When did Tame Impala release their second album?","correct":"2012","wrong":["2015","2010","1967"]},{"id":"d8292cc81d1d","q":"Which of these aliases has NOT been used by electronic musician Aphex Twin?","correct":"Burial","wrong":["Caustic Window","Bradley Strider","GAK"]},{"id":"d0e702fb1955","q":"Which of these songs was NOT released in the 90s?","correct":"\"I Want It All\" by Queen","wrong":["\"Vogue\" by Madonna","\"Can't Stop This Thing We Started\" by Bryan Adams","\"King of Wishful Thinking\" by Go West"]},{"id":"819414adb99f","q":"Moby, an American DJ, singer, and musician, achieved worldwide success for the 1999 release of which of the following albums?","correct":"Play","wrong":["Everything Is Wrong","Moby","18"]},{"id":"5bef1300a3df","q":"What's the most common time signature for rock songs?","correct":"4/4","wrong":["1/2","8/12","2/4"]},{"id":"0f81cc1718a0","q":"Which one of these songs did the group \"Men At Work\" NOT make?","correct":"Safety Dance","wrong":["Down Under","Who Can It Be Now?","It's a Mistake"]},{"id":"95bd4084fdef","q":"Which artist collaborated with American DJ Dillon Francis to release the song 2016 \"Need You\"?","correct":"NGHTMRE","wrong":["LOUDPVCK","KRNE","DVBBS"]},{"id":"2fb3d54b4adc","q":"\"Lift Your Spirit\" is an album by which artist?","correct":"Aloe Blacc","wrong":["Lena Meyer-Landrut","Stevie Wonder","Taylor Swift"]},{"id":"0fc6d7fffda8","q":"Whose albums included \"Back in Black\" and \"Ballbreaker\"?","correct":"AC/DC","wrong":["Iron Maiden","Black Sabbath","Metallica"]},{"id":"95a01501f0d4","q":"Dallon Weekes, former touring basist of Panic! At the Disco, created his own band in 2016 called...","correct":"I Don't Know How But They Found Me","wrong":["Cheats At Hide And Seek","Where Did You All Come From?","Run Away From The People"]},{"id":"92515b89c642","q":"Which of these is NOT a song featured on Green Day's 21st Century Breakdown album?","correct":"She's A Rebel","wrong":["Know Your Enemy","&iquest;Viva la Gloria? (Little Girl)","Before The Lobotomy"]},{"id":"39917771d36b","q":"Which of these songs is NOT in The Beatles' album \"Sgt. Pepper's Lonely Hearts Club Band\"?","correct":"Strawberry Fields Forever","wrong":["Getting Better","Fixing a Hole","Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds"]},{"id":"59f5bbb39496","q":"For which civil rights activist did Stevie Wonder write the song 'Happy Birthday' in 1980?","correct":"Martin Luther King Jr","wrong":["Rosa Parks","Nelson Mandella","Booker T. Washington"]},{"id":"7dec215b1652","q":"In 2006, which band released their debut album \"A Fever You Can't Sweat Out\"?","correct":"Panic! At the Disco","wrong":["Twenty One Pilots","My Chemical Romance","Fall Out Boy"]},{"id":"dc75f9c914ba","q":"Which of these artists has NOT been a member of dancehall group Major Lazer?","correct":"Skrillex","wrong":["Diplo","Jillionaire","Walshy Fire"]},{"id":"7c12d19d165b","q":"Who was the previous drummer of blink-182 before Travis Barker?","correct":"Scott Raynor","wrong":["Atom Willard","Ilan Rubin","Derek Grant"]},{"id":"d5b8bac53098","q":"In the song “The Ultimate Showdown of Ultimate Destiny,” who is the only one to survive the battle?","correct":"Mr. Rogers","wrong":["Batman","Chuck Norris","Godzilla"]},{"id":"a777c7753614","q":"What is the name of the 2016 mixtape released by Venezuelan electronic producer Arca?","correct":"Entrañas","wrong":["&&&&&&","Sheep","Xen"]},{"id":"0d372a7c67b0","q":"Which of these is NOT a song on The Beatles' 1968 self titled album, also known as the White album?","correct":"Being For The Benefit Of Mr. Kite!","wrong":["Why Don't We Do It in the Road?","Everybody's Got Something to Hide Except Me and My Monkey","The Continuing Story of Bungalow Bill"]},{"id":"d84c1f7a2c84","q":"Who is the primary lyricist for Canadian progressive rock band Rush?","correct":"Neil Peart","wrong":["Geddy Lee","Alex Lifeson","John Rutsey"]},{"id":"2422cc109110","q":"Which of the following is an album by punk rock band Anti-Flag?","correct":"For Blood And Empire","wrong":["Infinity On High","21st Century Breakdown","No Pads, No Helmets...Just Balls"]},{"id":"f25fbc4987bc","q":"Which of these is the name of a song by Tears for Fears?","correct":"Shout","wrong":["Scream","Yell","Shriek"]},{"id":"4ec1a9430af8","q":"Which artist released his third and final studio album 'Electric Ladyland' before his death in 1970?","correct":"Jimi Hendrix","wrong":["Prince","Eric Clapton","Captain Sensible"]},{"id":"70c659473070","q":"\"The Genius\" is the original and secondary name of which Wu-Tang Clan member?","correct":"GZA","wrong":["Ghostface Killah","Ol' Dirty Bastard","Raekwon the Chef"]},{"id":"f1094ac8c748","q":"Who is the lead singer of Arctic Monkeys?","correct":"Alex Turner","wrong":["Jamie Cook","Matt Helders","Nick O'Malley"]},{"id":"c79604857970","q":"Which of these artists did NOT remix the song \"Faded\" by Alan Walker?","correct":"Skrillex","wrong":["Ti&euml;sto","Slushii","Dash Berlin"]},{"id":"42578b7c66eb","q":"In an orchestra, what is the lowest member of the brass family?","correct":"Tuba","wrong":["Trombone","Contrabass","Bassoon"]},{"id":"22e47d6a6027","q":"What kind of instrument is a \"Mandolin\"?","correct":"String","wrong":["Brass","Percussion","Woodwind"]},{"id":"1b80adb46566","q":"The Red Hot Chili Pepper song \"Give It Away\" is from what album?","correct":"Blood Sugar Sex Magik","wrong":["One Hot Minute","By the Way","Stadium Arcadium"]},{"id":"7ba42f089161","q":"In which year did \"Caravan Palace\" release their first album?","correct":"2008","wrong":["2000","2015","2004"]},{"id":"9ba20cea8f6c","q":"Which of these artists was NOT a member of the electronic music supergroup Swedish House Mafia, which split up in 2013?","correct":"Alesso","wrong":["Steve Angello","Sebastian Ingrosso","Axwell"]},{"id":"290a5262f482","q":"The Rush song \"YYZ\" derives its name from the IATA aiport identification code for which city?","correct":"Toronto","wrong":["Vancouver","Ottawa","Calgary"]},{"id":"96764369a907","q":"Which band, with Boy George on lead vocals, won the Brit Awards in 1984?","correct":"Culture Club","wrong":["Eurythmics","UB40","The Police"]},{"id":"2c2abdee88fd","q":"The four strings on a violin are the G string, D string, A string, and...","correct":"E string","wrong":["C string","B string","F string"]},{"id":"82aaf92fc2a4","q":"Which of these songs was released in 1996?","correct":"The Smashing Pumpkins - \"1979\"","wrong":["Prince - \"1999\"","James Blunt - \"1973\"","David Bowie - \"1984\""]},{"id":"4b8cbdae4aaf","q":"What is the opening track on Lorde's Pure Heroine?","correct":"Tennis Court","wrong":["Team","Royals","400 Lux"]},{"id":"966c9d097c54","q":"Which of these languages was NOT included in the 2016 song \"Don't Mind\" by Kent Jones?","correct":"Portuguese","wrong":["Japanese","French","Spanish"]},{"id