l is in which country?","correct":"Marshall Islands","wrong":["Fiji","Christmas Islands","Bahamas"]},{"id":"bfbe0f6abe3f","q":"What is the capital city of New Zealand?","correct":"Wellington","wrong":["Auckland","Christchurch","Melbourne"]},{"id":"73e7f9f1ec21","q":"What is the name of the ocean that Hawaii is located in?","correct":"Pacific","wrong":["Atlantic","Indian","Arctic"]},{"id":"ea395f4ee807","q":"What is the fifth largest country by area?","correct":"Brazil","wrong":["United States","Australia","India"]},{"id":"811fe0441402","q":"What colour is the circle on the Japanese flag?","correct":"Red","wrong":["White","Yellow","Black"]},{"id":"f8586b48318a","q":"In which city is the Big Nickel located in Canada?","correct":"Sudbury, Ontario","wrong":["Calgary, Alberta","Halifax, Nova Scotia","Victoria, British Columbia"]},{"id":"e1fb51ff44da","q":"Which country does Austria not border?","correct":"France","wrong":["Slovenia","Switzerland","Slovakia"]},{"id":"1df1830466cf","q":"The emblem on the flag of the Republic of Tajikistan features a sunrise over mountains below what symbol?","correct":"Crown","wrong":["Bird","Sickle","Tree"]},{"id":"8e5aa09a60f5","q":"In the 2016 Global Peace Index poll, out of 163 countries, what was the United States of America ranked?","correct":"103","wrong":["10","59","79"]},{"id":"a26aa00dfee1","q":"What city is the Terracotta Army located in?","correct":"Xi'an","wrong":["Beijing","Shanghai","Hong Kong"]},{"id":"65f1c1813e50","q":"What is the largest country, by area, that has only one time zone?","correct":"China","wrong":["Canada","India","Russia"]},{"id":"1b73299f3a51","q":"What is the region conjoining Pakistan, India, and China with unknown leadership called?","correct":"Kashmir","wrong":["Andorra","Gibraltar","Quin"]},{"id":"6780588fdeb0","q":"How many countries share a land border with Luxembourg?","correct":"3","wrong":["4","2","5"]},{"id":"ef0a87ed0577","q":"Which of the following European languages is classified as a \"language isolate?\"","correct":"Basque","wrong":["Galician","Maltese","Hungarian"]},{"id":"e1dec375a07d","q":"What is the smallest country in South America by area?","correct":"Suriname","wrong":["Brazil","Uruguay","Chile"]},{"id":"ef0848b5ca2a","q":"In 2012 the German-speaking microstate \"Liechtenstein\" in Central Europe had a population of how many inhabitants?","correct":"36,600","wrong":["2,400","90,000","323,400"]},{"id":"bdf47835b2c5","q":"Which river was dammed to create Gatun Lake and the Panama Canal?","correct":"Chagres River","wrong":["Tuira River","Chucunaque River","Chepo River"]},{"id":"0c89525e2bb3","q":"Where is the world's oldest still operational space launch facility located?","correct":"Kazakhstan","wrong":["Russia","Iran","United States"]},{"id":"e663eb47f715","q":"On which continent/s is the entire country of Spain specifically located when taking into account all of its territory?","correct":"Europe and Africa","wrong":["Europe, Africa and Asia","Europe","Europe and Asia"]},{"id":"8cfbd48bfc14","q":"How many countries border Kyrgyzstan?","correct":"4","wrong":["3","1","6"]},{"id":"e09b9552e66a","q":"What is the capital of Slovakia?","correct":"Bratislava","wrong":["Sofia","Ljubljana","Sarajevo"]},{"id":"7ea3387f802b","q":"What is the capital of British Columbia, Canada?","correct":"Victoria","wrong":["Vancouver","Hope","Kelowna"]},{"id":"268c5f289c2a","q":"The White Cliffs of Dover is located in which country?","correct":"United Kingdom","wrong":["United States","Netherlands","Sweden"]},{"id":"b24d8494eded","q":"How many independent countries are there within the continent of South America?","correct":"12","wrong":["8","9","10"]},{"id":"7e4c625fbc3c","q":"The Principality of Sealand is an unrecognized micronation off the coast of what country?","correct":"The United Kingdom","wrong":["Japan","Austrailia","Argentina"]},{"id":"71b286489aff","q":"Which of these countries is NOT the only country to start with that letter of the alphabet?","correct":