in range lie?","correct":"South America","wrong":["Europe","Asia","Africa"]},{"id":"6255e6e386ee","q":"What is the capital of Vietnam?","correct":"Hanoi","wrong":["Da Nang","Hai Phong","Ho Chi Minh City"]},{"id":"56f7c9281932","q":"All of the following countries have official claims to territory in Antartica EXCEPT:","correct":"United States","wrong":["Australia","Chile","Norway"]},{"id":"4e57dcbb575f","q":"Which is the largest freshwater lake in the world?","correct":"Lake Superior","wrong":["Caspian Sea","Lake Michigan","Lake Huron"]},{"id":"06f710f62d20","q":"Frankenmuth, a US city nicknamed \"Little Bavaria\", is located in what state?","correct":"Michigan","wrong":["Pennsylvania","Kentucky","Virginia"]},{"id":"55e12858428a","q":"What is the capital of Scotland?","correct":"Edinburgh","wrong":["Glasgow","Dundee","London"]},{"id":"b18e38e7d5c1","q":"Which city is the biggest in Canada?","correct":"Toronto","wrong":["Montreal","Vancouver","Ottawa"]},{"id":"718a8fb501b0","q":"In Washington, D.C. what does the \"C\" stand for?","correct":"Columbia","wrong":["Caledonia","Corinthia","City"]},{"id":"e61055394d86","q":"What is the longest river in Europe?","correct":"Volga","wrong":["Danube","Rhine","Thames"]},{"id":"f10336bc0d93","q":"Which is the largest city in Morocco?","correct":"Casablanca","wrong":["Rabat","Fes","Sale"]},{"id":"b1bf25af308b","q":"Kuala Lumpur is the capital of which country?","correct":"Malaysia","wrong":["Indonesia","Singapore","Thailand"]},{"id":"61e86f75edd4","q":"What is the capital of Burkina Faso?","correct":"Ouagadougou","wrong":["Yaoundé","Yamoussoukro","Abidjan"]},{"id":"f75187a8f823","q":"Gibraltar, located just south of the Iberian peninsula, is a territory of which West Europe country?","correct":"United Kingdom","wrong":["Spain","Portugal","France"]},{"id":"0bb2aad995e3","q":"What is the capital of the US state Nevada?","correct":"Carson City","wrong":["Las Vegas","Henderson","Reno"]},{"id":"417681f7730b","q":"Ouagadougou is the capi